gametitle=Guilty Gear XX Accent Core Plus (NTSC-U) [SLUS-21847] (F233A433)
comment=Explicit first Continue hands off to continuous native Survival. Configured elapsed time starts at zero and stays marked CUSTOM. US only; use this module alone.

[ggmod: Survival Practice Continue]
author=retro-graphics-research
description=R1 on SURVIVAL for setup. Continue once for an uninterrupted run; Retry restores the configured start. Custom timer is visibly marked. No diagnostic damage or EXP aid; disable and reboot to unload.
